### Check balances
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/wallets/W1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/wallets/W2

### Successful transfer → 204
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromWalletId": "W1", "toWalletId": "W2", "amount": 200 }

### 1. Wallet doesn't exist → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromWalletId": "W1", "toWalletId": "W99", "amount": 10 }

### 2. Insufficient funds → 422
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromWalletId": "W2", "toWalletId": "W1", "amount": 9999 }

### 3. Negative amount → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromWalletId": "W1", "toWalletId": "W2", "amount": -5 }

### 4. Same wallet → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromWalletId": "W1", "toWalletId": "W1", "amount": 10 }

### 5. Sender frozen → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromWalletId": "W3", "toWalletId": "W1", "amount": 10 }

### Missing field → 400 from @Valid
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromWalletId": "W1", "amount": 10 }